I'm currently playing a Valkyrie (but of course...) and I've gotten
down to the castle with a +6 rustproofed Mjollnir.  On level 20 I picked
up gauntlets, and so I was all set.

I went around to the back entrance of the castle, and, after a minor skirmish
with a master lich, headed to the back door, just past the pits.  Well,
they were waiting for me, and as soon as I opened the door, there was a 
big, beautiful frost giant with a nice, big boulder.  He died and left 
the boulder.  Ok.  So I throw my trusty hammer past the boulder and into
the throne room.  Thwack!  I do it again.  Hm...  This is boring, and it'll
take a long time.  Ok.  I'll use ^A.  Hmmm...  Biff!  Bam!  Sproing!  Dead
yet?  Nope...  Baff!  Whap!  Crunch!  Dead yet?  Almost...  Thud.  
